WEBVTT

00:29:58.788 --> 00:30:03.204
that that I had to do that stuff
in order to realize that.

00:30:05.038 --> 00:30:09.329
That I wasn't the person my father raised
me to be, my father didn't raise me,

00:30:09.829 --> 00:30:11.913
I was the person my mother
raised me to be.

00:30:12.413 --> 00:30:13.746
And the best thing I could do,

00:30:13.746 --> 00:30:17.246
and this is why I said that so much of
that stuff was about love, as I realized,

00:30:17.246 --> 00:30:19.954
like I was trying to show
the world, listen,

00:30:19.954 --> 00:30:23.621
this amazing woman is gone
and I am suffering.

00:30:23.954 --> 00:30:26.121
I wanted to, you know, with my own life,

00:30:26.996 --> 00:30:30.663
demonstrate how how how gigantic
that loss was.